{
    desc => q{f{char} moves cursor forward to next occurrence of character},
    description => <<'END_DESC',
## Macro: `xt/visual/macros/find_char_f`

**f{char}** moves the cursor forward to the next occurrence of the specified character on the current line.

**Keys:** `fo`

**initial.png**
- Cursor at line 1, col 0 (on 'h' of "hello")
- Text: `hello world`

**after_fo.png**
- Cursor moved to first 'o' in "hello" at col 4
- Text unchanged
END_DESC
    run => sub {
        my ($ctx) = @_;
        $ctx->buffer->set_text($CODE);
        $ctx->delay(100);
        $ctx->snapshot('initial');
        $ctx->delay(100);
        $ctx->keys('fo');
        $ctx->delay(100);
        $ctx->snapshot('after_fo');
    },
}
__DATA__
hello world
